\" lang=\"ja\">ひんじゃく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">贫弱；瘦弱；微薄；简陋；不充实</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">怒</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>愤怒；生气；发怒</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ド・ヌ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いか.る・おこ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">怒る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いかる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">生气；发怒；棱角分明；方正</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">怒り</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いかり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">愤怒；怒气；狂怒；愤慨</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">泳</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>游泳</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">およ.ぐ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">泳ぐ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">およぐ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">游泳；挤过；穿过（人群）；在世上立足；谋生；混世；蹒跚；踉跄；失去平衡</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">水泳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すいえい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">游泳</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">泳ぎ方</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">およぎかた</span><span class=\"k-wz\">游泳方式；泳姿</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">祖</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>祖先；先驱；创始人</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">お祖父さん</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おじいさん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">祖父；爷爷；老年男性；老头儿</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">祖父</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そふ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">祖父；爷爷；老人；老汉；狂言老人面具</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">祖母</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そぼ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">祖母；外婆；奶奶</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">杯</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>酒杯；杯（计量单位）；干杯</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さかずき</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">乾杯</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんぱい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">干杯；敬酒；为某人或某事祝酒；干杯；一饮而尽；喝干杯中酒</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">杯</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さかずき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">酒杯；盛酒的杯子；交杯；以杯酒交换来确认盟约或誓言</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">疲</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>疲劳；疲倦；累</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヒ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つか.れる・-づか.れ・つか.らす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">疲れる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つかれる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">疲劳；疲倦；劳累；疲惫；磨损；磨旧；挨饿；饥饿</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">疲れ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つかれ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">疲劳；疲倦；倦怠</span></li