\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はら</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">腹</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はら</span><span class=\"k-wz\">腹部；肚子；胃；子宫；胎内；心意；真实意图；真实动机；勇气；胆量；意志力；慷慨；宽宏大量；感情；情感；宽阔的中间部分；凸起的部分；内部；内里；里面；波腹；鱼子计数；鼓腹容器（罐、瓶等）计数</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">空腹</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くうふく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">空腹；饥饿</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">山腹</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さんぷく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">山腰；山坡</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">煙</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>烟；冒烟；烟草</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">けむ.る・けむり・けむ.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">煙</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けむり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">烟；烟雾</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">禁煙</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きんえん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">戒烟；禁止吸烟；禁烟；（告示牌用语）禁止吸烟；请勿吸烟</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">煙突</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えんとつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">烟囱；烟筒；（船的）烟囱；炉管；不打表载客</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">眠</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>睡觉；困倦；死亡</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ミン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=