\" lang=\"ja\">じびか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">耳鼻科；耳鼻喉科</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">頂</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>顶；戴（在头上）；接受；山顶；顶峰</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いただ.く・いただき</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">頂上</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょうじょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">顶端；顶点；峰顶</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">頂点</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょうてん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">顶点；尖端；山顶；峰顶；最高点；业界最高层；领域顶峰；高峰；巅峰；极点；鼎盛</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">頂</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いただき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">头顶；山顶；尖顶；轻松取胜；所得之物；收获</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">箱</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>箱子；盒子；匣子；容器；车厢</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はこ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">箱</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はこ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">箱子；盒子；柜子；包裹；包装；板条箱；（火车等的）车厢；三味线套；三味线；公共建筑；社区建筑；为艺妓携带三味线的男性；人类排泄物容器；粪便；箱（或盒装物品的计数单位）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">晩</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>夜晚；傍晚</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">バン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">晩</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ばん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">晚上；夜晚；晚餐；晚饭；夜（计数单位）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">今晩</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こんばん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">今晚；今天晚上</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">毎晩</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まいばん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">每晚；每天晚上</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">寒</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>寒冷；冷</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さむ.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">寒い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さむい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">寒冷；冷；无聊；冷；乏味；老套</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">寒帯</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんたい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">寒带</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">寒気</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">寒冷；冷气；寒气</span></li></ul></div></li>"]